# Repository map (MX Fantasy League)

Use this index **before** broad searches. Conventions: `AGENTS.md`.  
New/changed series: **Series playbook** (`.cursor/rules/series-playbook.mdc`).  
Product backlog: `IDEAS.md` (KanalHugget = `IDEAS-KANALHUGGET.md`, not this site).  
Refactor progress / next slice: `docs/REFACTOR.md`.

## Agent working rules (short)

1. Prefer `app/routes/` + `services/` for new work — **do not grow `main.py`**.
2. Keep bare `url_for('…')` working via endpoint aliases in `main.py` when moving routes.
3. Series codes must be wired end-to-end (playbook checklist) — never half-register.
4. Swedish UI copy lives in templates; English comments in code.
5. After meaningful structure changes, update **this file** and `AGENTS.md` map.

## Entry points

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `main.py` | **Production** WSGI (`gunicorn main:app`). Still large (~23k lines). Registers blueprints + many leftover routes/helpers. |
| `app/__init__.py` | `create_app()` — subset of blueprints (gradual migration). |
| `app.py` | Legacy; avoid for new features. |
| `models.py` | All SQLAlchemy models (single file). |
| `wsgi.py` | Host hook if used. |

