## Front-end

- Templates: `templates/` (Jinja2, Swedish). Homepage = `templates/index.html`.
- CSS/JS: `static/` (images often `.cursorignore`d — search path strings in code).
- PWA: `static/sw.js`.

## Data / env

- Migrations: `migrations/versions/`
- Seed/data: `data/`
- Env: `env.example` — never commit `.env`
- Flags worth knowing: `SEASON_TEAM_PROMO_LIVE`, `SEASON_TEAM_COMBINED_LIVE`, `PARIS_PUBLIC_PLAY`, `MXGP_PUBLIC_PLAY`, `MXSM_PUBLIC_PLAY`

## Intentionally not indexed

See `.cursorignore` (bulk images, `tools/gs`, caches). Asset paths: grep literals in `.py` / templates.
